{"version":1,"content":"<p>儘管 Mac 與 iPad 在過去幾年中變得越來越相似，但蘋果表示並不打算將 macOS 和 iPadOS 合併為單一作業系統。隨着首款觸控版 MacBook Pro 的推出，外界關於蘋果是否最終打造統一平台的猜測再度升温，而蘋果高層給出的答案依然是否定的。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585032.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T15:26:37.149849+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":134,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T14:58:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T15:19:05.768450+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T15:19:05.768450+00:00","content_hash":"c0315e9e2a1370c16f7bbe94f9941255d026deec848cfc9aec8198fa81218662","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}